{"title":"Jump in Scopus Ranking for IAFOR Journal of Education","link":"https://iafor.org/jump-in-scopus-ranking-for-iafor-journal-of-education/","date":1718588186000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Scopus-Journals-Education-2024-narrow-150x150.jpg\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Scopus-Journals-Education-2024-narrow-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Scopus-Journals-Education-2024-narrow-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Scopus-Journals-Education-2024-narrow-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Scopus-Journals-Education-2024-narrow-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Scopus-Journals-Education-2024-narrow-32x32.jpg 32w\" />Congratulations to IAFOR Journal of Education! Scopus, the top citation database, released its updated CiteScore rank for 2023 and the IAFOR Journal of Education continues in its upward trajectory. The journal saw a big leap in the rankings. According to the figures, the journal moved up from the 2022 CiteScore of 1.6 (rank #831/1463 – <a href=\"https://iafor.org/jump-in-scopus-ranking-for-iafor-journal-of-education/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/jump-in-scopus-ranking-for-iafor-journal-of-education/\">Source</a></p>","author":"Publications","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"8a581a1a0f2127c5aad0b9a049f13c8375ef29818980546e9f91ff784538c34e","category":"Interdisciplinary"}